hygonstat is based on the command-line experience of gpustat and directly
reuses gpustat's GPUStat and GPUStatCollection formatting interfaces through
a runtime dependency. Its Hygon data collector and command entry point are
implemented separately.

gpustat was created by Jongwook Choi and is developed by its contributors.
